branch: claude/piano-roll-clip-view-wozlie
notes: Makes the Arrangement timeline interactive (professional DAW behaviour). While the song plays, tapping a section in the visual timeline canvas jumps straight to it — loading that section's clip immediately so it plays from its first step. Inert when stopped (the section list below stays the editor). Pure MainActor control logic: new ArrangementCursor.seek(to:sectionCount:) (restarts the section from bar 0, out-of-range = no-op) + ArrangementPlayer.jump(to:). No audio-thread coupling. Unit-tested: cursor seek + out-of-range no-op run on Linux ci.yml; player jump + jump-when-stopped no-op compile on the macOS gate. Builds on v10.53/54 Transport unification + timeline canvas.
